@cajunjoel : I was curious if it was possible to add some GTG-related icons to the list of emojis available on the site? Specifically things like the (attached) Sentinel Comics RPG icons? It will facilitate discussions around those topics, if they could be available, but I have no idea if that's an option or how that could be accomplished. (We already had one where we used a different emoji that worked okay, but it would be much better if we used the real thing. :) )

